 "remarks": "Located just a few blocks from the heart of Bedford Street, one of Stamford's most prime locations for a walkable lifestyle, yet tucked away in a quiet neighborhood, you will find this updated 2 bedroom unit. You won't want to miss the modern kitchen with granite countertops, beautiful backsplash, stainless steel appliances and breakfast bar overlooking the bright living room. The bonus sun-room easily serves as an office, play room or dining area! Hardwood floors throughout, spacious bedrooms with generous closets and stylish bathroom, too! The charming covered front porch and the back deck area for barbecuing - both optimal for outdoor entertaining - tops off this perfect downtown rental! Other great features include an in-unit full-sized washer/dryer, 1 garage space included with additional parking, too! Come check out your next place to call home within walking distance to the hottest restaurants, shops, theaters, train station & more!",
